Description: antinomie: add independent process-tree and userspace capture sessions
Author: MikiMiku <jonathanirvinjo@gmail.com>
Origin: project
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-09

Independent observer identities preserve launched program ownership; attach current threads and future descendants or capture all userspace, with frozen syscall and async tails.

